      "name": "Ben Erickson",
      "created_at": "2026-03-21T09:33:23.203Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think it goes back to v14 actually:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubpullrequest\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/35330\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/35330\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/erpnext</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Pull Request\">\n      <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11 11.28V5c-.03-.78-.34-1.47-.94-2.06C9.46 2.35 8.78 2.03 8 2H7V0L4 3l3 3V4h1c.27.02.48.11.69.31.21.2.3.42.31.69v6.28A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 10 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72zm-1 2.92c-.66 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2zM4 3c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2a1.993 1.993 0 0 0-1 3.72v6.56A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 2 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72V4.72c.59-.34 1-.98 1-1.72zm-.8 10c0 .66-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2-.65 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2zM2 4.2C1.34 4.2.8 3.65.8 3c0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2z\"></path></svg>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n\n\n\n      <h4>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/35330\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">refactor: cr/dr note should be standalone even when created from another invoice</a>\n      </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"branches\">\n      <code>develop</code> ← <code>ruthra-kumar:cr_note_posts_gl_for_itself</code>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"github-info\">\n        <div class=\"date\">\n          opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2023-05-16\" data-time=\"12:05:31\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">12:05PM - 16 May 23 UTC</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"user\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ruthra-kumar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n            <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3272205?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n            ruthra-kumar\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"lines\" title=\"7 commits changed 8 files with 83 additions and 37 deletions\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/35330/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n            <span class=\"added\">+83</span>\n            <span class=\"removed\">-37</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">Credit/Debit Notes should post ledger against itself(standalone), even if they a<span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/35330\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">re created against a parent invoice. This way, they can be reconciled against a different invoice from same customer/supplier.</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<aside class=\"onebox githubissue\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/36170\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/36170\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/erpnext</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n  <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Issue\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n\t  <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n    <h4>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/36170\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reuse payments after credit note</a>\n    </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"github-info\">\n      <div class=\"date\">\n        opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2023-07-17\" data-time=\"15:47:39\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">03:47PM - 17 Jul 23 UTC</span>\n      </div>\n\n        <div class=\"date\">\n          closed <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2025-12-08\" data-time=\"13:10:51\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">01:10PM - 08 Dec 25 UTC</span>\n        </div>\n\n      <div class=\"user\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/barredterra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14891507?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n          barredterra\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"labels\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          bug\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          accounts\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">### Information about bug\n\n1. Create a **Sales Invoice** and an according **Paym<span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">ent Entry**\n2. Issue a credit note against the **Sales Invoice**\n\nNow what happens with the received payment?\n\n- There's no easy way to reconcile the **Payment Entry** with a different **Sales Invoice**.\n- There's no easy way to create a return **Payment Entry**.\n\n### Module\n\naccounts\n\n### Version\n\n14+\n\n### Installation method\n\nNone\n\n### Relevant log output / Stack trace / Full Error Message.\n\n_No response_</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
